vectors.json: interop vectors for draft-atwood-mls-didwebvh-credential-00.

Generator: generate.mjs (this directory), run as `node generate.mjs` with
Node v26.13.1, built-in crypto only, no npm packages. It
implements JCS (RFC 8785), base58btc, multihash, did:webvh v1.0 entry
construction (spec-v1.0 at decentralized-identity/didwebvh 91f3cba) and
eddsa-jcs-2022 proofs itself, independently of mimid's Rust code, and
checks its JCS and multihash against the entry-hash example in did:webvh
v1.0 §Generate Entry Hash before writing anything. Every expected outcome
is written in generate.mjs from the draft's text, with its section.
Output is deterministic (keys from fixed names, fixed times).

